flowchart LR
    R[Request] --> N{Network<br/>reachable?}
    N -- no --> F1[URLError]
    N -- yes --> S{HTTP status<br/>200?}
    S -- no --> F2[HTTPError]
    S -- yes --> B{Body is<br/>valid JSON?}
    B -- no --> F3[ValueError:<br/>JSONDecodeError]
    B -- yes --> K{Expected keys<br/>present?}
    K -- no --> F4[KeyError<br/>or empty result]
    K -- yes --> OK[Use the data]
